      "message": "feat(app): operation-level picks for toolpath start and exit positions\n\nMove toolpath start and exit picks from links.approach to operation-level\nPathPicks across OpParams. This unifies start and exit point selection\nfor operations with or without level linking ladders.\n\nMigrate legacy project files with approach start and exit points, or wire\nstart coordinates, into the operation picks record. Expose start and exit\npicks through MCP edit_operation and add_operation.\n\nPinned by contour_start_point, start_exit_shared, and contour_start tests.\n\nFixes #3339",
